    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, you know, I was talking to the director or constituent who actually is the director of one of our largest hospitals, labor and delivery wards. And she told me that 40% of the babies born right now have at least one parent addicted to fentanyl. I mean, it is ravaging a lot of southwest Washington and my community as well.",
