    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/4/94468.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "You know, it's honestly in some ways it was it was, you know, you always think that it's like, well, it's just like, oh, it's my family, my community, my play groups. But no, it's everywhere. It is everywhere. And people experience it in isolation and without, you know, I think that isolation festers in a way that's less productive than talking about the reality of what it's like to live, you know, in communities that are so impacted by this.",
