      },
      {
        "text": "Social norms discourage open discussion about certain difficult realities.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Collective dialogue reduces the psychological burden of individual isolation.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Speaking truthfully about hardship fosters empathy and connection among affected individuals.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has credibility due to personal or observed experience with the phenomenon.",
