        "text": "The speaker believes the New York Times article is a reliable source of the quoted claim.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that 'condescension' has observable, real-world manifestations that can be described.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts that the respondent has firsthand experience or credible observations regarding political behavior.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the identification of specific examples as valuable for understanding the broader critique.",
