        "text": "Real legislation requires significant time and effort.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Real work takes time.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "People sometimes pass bills because it sounds good rather than because it addresses real problems.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Improving legislation involves thoughtful revision and refinement.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Building a legislative coalition involves identifying both opponents and supporters.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Some issues are created artificially because they lack natural predators.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
