    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "It's funny. I see that in the context of the right to repair. I mean, you're still fixing things. In this case, you're making a bill better as far as you're concerned.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
