        "text": "You're still fixing things.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "I see that in the context of the right to repair.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "In this case, you're making a bill better as far as you're concerned.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
