    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "Well, like I said, I mean, it takes time to build the coalition. And it's like, you know, I think, you know, if you've got, you know, if if John Deere is one of your donors, people are less likely to want to you know, get on board. And what is exciting to me is seeing how kind of seeing the like the non-political agency of like people online who do not identify as partisan, but understand the deep like this is personal to them. And they are flexing and building muscle to change things. And so seeing this grow from the inside out is, I think that's been a real encouragement to me and that is moving my colleagues and my advocacy on it. I can speak to it in a different way than maybe they've seen before.",
