    "turn_idx": 32,
    "turn_text": "Oh, it all works, yeah. But yeah, no, I mean, it's not like, it's like, There's one big, you know, there's no one weird trick to like pass legislation. You know, I think I try to like, you know, my colleagues are human. Like there's a lot of different things. Like, you know, but there definitely is, there definitely is real lobbying. And, you know, I guess, you know, if you're, if you are, if you are driving in 1997, Toyota, you are not, Um, maybe you don't have the time to write your legislator, right? So like that's the perspective I try to bring and elevate that like, you know, if you I've told colleagues like if you pull this in your district, it'll pull at 80% approval like people really like this. Um, but. They don't have time to write you about it",
